---

<Base title="About" description="About Jefrey Jurado, graphic designer and layout artist from Laguna, Philippines.">
  <article class="wrap">
    <div class="crumbs label">
      <span>Profile</span>
      <span>{site.location}</span>
    </div>

    <header class="head">
      <p class="kicker">About the designer</p>
      <h1>Twelve years of deadlines, layouts and good type</h1>
      <p class="deck">
        A graphic designer and layout artist who learned the craft on weekly newspapers, and brings the same
        discipline to magazines, packaging and social media.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="body">
      <p class="dropcap">
        I'm Jefrey Jurado, a graphic designer and layout artist from Laguna, Philippines. Most of my career has
        been in publishing. I've designed weekly newspapers, monthly magazines, and the legal and editorial pages
        in between, so I know how to make dense content clear and how to get files to the press on time.
      </p>
      <p>
        Outside print, I've designed packaging for food brands, social media campaigns for insurance and
        education clients, logos for small businesses, and commemorative photo albums for religious
        institutions. I also studied IT (Software Development), so I'm comfortable working with web and app
        teams.
      </p>
      <p>
        I'm open to <strong>full-time roles</strong> and <strong>freelance projects</strong>, and willing to
        relocate.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="actions">
      <a href={site.resume} class="btn btn--solid" target="_blank">Download rÃ©sumÃ© (PDF)</a>
      <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`} class="btn">Email me</a>
    </div>

    <section class="section">
      <p class="flag"><span>Experience</span><span>2014 â€” present</span></p>
      <ol class="timeline">
        {
          experience.map((e) => (
            <li>
              <span class="years">{e.years}</span>
              <div>
                <h3>{e.role}</h3>
                <p class="org">{e.org}</p>
              </div>
              <p class="text">{e.text}</p>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="section split">
      <div>
        <p class="flag"><span>Tools</span></p>
        <ul class="tools">{tools.map((t) => <li>{t}</li>)}</ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="flag"><span>Education</span></p>
        <ul class="edu">
          <li>
            <h3>BS Information Technology, Software Development</h3>
            <p>MapÃºa Malayan Digital College Â· 2023 â€“ 2026 (undergraduate)</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3>BA in Communication</h3>
            <p>Mater Redemptoris College Â· 2010 â€“ 2013</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .crumbs {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 16px 0 10px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .head {
    padding: clamp(32px, 6vw, 64px) 0 clamp(24px, 3vw, 36px);
    text-align: center;
    border-bottom: 3px solid var(--ink);
  }

  .head h1 {
    max-width: 12em;
    margin: 12px auto 18px;
    font-size: clamp(48px, 8vw, 112px);
  }

  .deck {
    text-wrap: balance;
    max-width: 30em;
    margin: 0 auto;
    font-size: clamp(20px, 2vw, 25px);
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.35;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .body {
    columns: 2 22em;
    column-gap: 40px;
    column-rule: 1px solid var(--hair);
    max-width: 960px;
    margin: 32px auto 0;
  }

  .body p + p {
    margin-top: 1em;
  }

  .body strong {
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 32px;
  }

  .section {
    padding-top: clamp(56px, 8vw, 88px);
  }

  .timeline {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .timeline li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 140px 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 6px 32px;
    padding: 18px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hair);
  }

  .years {
    font-family: var(--head);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--spot);
  }

  .timeline h3 {
    font-size: 26px;
    line-height: 1.05;
  }

  .org {
    margin-top: 4px;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .text {
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .timeline li {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .split {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: clamp(40px, 6vw, 80px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .split {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .tools {
    columns: 2;
    margin: 16px 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .tools li {
    padding: 8px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hair);
    break-inside: avoid;
  }

  .edu {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
    margin: 16px 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .edu h3 {
    font-size: 26px;
    line-height: 1.05;
  }

  .edu p {
    margin-top: 6px;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
</style>
